+If you use Claude Code, update it first, because a newer model can need a newer version of Claude Code. Then, check which model you're using, even if you set no model or use a Claude Code alias such as `sonnet`. If that model is deprecated or retired, set its recommended replacement as your model. Also, change the old model everywhere you set a model, including subagent definitions, and ask your administrator to change any model they set.
